// Consumes: v4.std.grammar, v4.std.lexing, v4.std.collection, v4.std.model_core, v4.std.target_model, v4.std.node, v4.std.logic, v4.std.algebra, v4.std.text.
// Status: T-4 wasm slice — Core §2.3.1 number types (i32/i64/f32/f64 wave-1); wave-2b: inhabitance+laws+effects+partiality; `core: ModelCore` (#3474); canonical_symbols = catalog surface spellings + wave-1 lex/grammar/MVP; target_model edge keys from std/target_model.dag; MVP-1 WAT grammar/token substrate for T-11; wave-1 productions declared as `FormalProduction` flat rhs (`wasm_wave1_formal_productions`); `GrammarExpr`/`GrammarRoot` remain operational parse scaffold until CP-1b convergence (dual-carrier hold); v128/funcref/externref 🟡 wave-2; integer sign-agnostic per spec (width + modular wrap, not signed/unsigned partition).
